            <div type="edition" xml:space="preserve" xml:lang="la" resp="#AV">
                <ab>
                    <lb n="1"/><placeName>Vercellensis</placeName> flaminis <placeName><expan><abbr>Me
                    <lb n="2" break="no"/>diola</abbr><ex>ni</ex></expan></placeName> <persName type="attested"><name><expan><abbr>Q</abbr><ex>uintus</ex></expan></name> <name>Atilius</name> <name>Eutyches</name></persName>
                    <lb n="3"/><num value="6">VI</num>vir <expan><abbr>Aug</abbr><ex>ustalis</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>c</abbr><ex cert="low">ultores</ex></expan> <persName type="divine" key="domusDivinae"><name><expan><abbr>d</abbr><ex cert="low">omus</ex></expan></name> <name><expan><abbr>d</abbr><ex cert="low">ivinae</ex></expan></name></persName> <expan><abbr>orna</abbr><supplied reason="lost"><abbr>m</abbr><ex>entis</ex></supplied></expan> <expan><abbr><supplied reason="lost">e</supplied>c</abbr><ex>urionalibus</ex></expan>
                    <lb n="4"/>uxori kariss<supplied reason="lost">i</supplied>mae quae <expan><abbr>vix</abbr><ex>it</ex></expan>
                    <lb n="5"/>cum eo annis <num value="15">XV</num> sine
                    <lb n="6"/>ulla <expan><abbr>quererel</abbr><ex>l</ex></expan>a
                </ab>
            </div>
            <div type="apparatus">
                <listApp>
                    <app><note>Text from EDR; with restoration of Fishwick 1991, 612</note></app>
                    <app loc="3"><note>EDR restores c(reatus) d(ecreto) d(ecurionum) in line 3.</note></app>
                </listApp>
            </div>
            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>Quintus Atilius Eutyches of Vercellae, flamen at Mediolanum, sexvir Augustalis, member of the worshippers of the divine house, ornamented with decurionial insignia, [set this up] for his dearest wife, who lived with him for 15 years without any complaint.</p>
            </div>
